e and easy to learn, so come and give it a try!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTips:\\u003cbr\\u003e1. Bottles of the same type can be packed together, up to a maximum of six.\\u003cbr\\u003e2. Want a bigger challenge? Try using power-ups!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach bottle you pack will help you get generous bonus.The more bottles you pack,the more rewards you will get.Enjoy smooth, satisfying clearing animations and generous rewards in this relaxing yet addictive game.\"],\"ApnaBankShop\",\"1.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1OFvlQTzaAo6Kiv7LoZVO2qCkttRb3i44V3uqx5eI1P4G2daZ_ViWTo-S5et-R1PsXEMyJBtLtx3dgjxODdbXg\"],null,[138,194,248,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003ePelajari lebih lanjut\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia. Beberapa kekerasan dalam konteks komikal atau fantasi dapat diterima. Bahasa kasar tidak diizinkan.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.apnabankshop.juice\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.apnabankshop.juice\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Instal\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Kasual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]