gems and coins while avoiding collisions.\\u003cbr\\u003e3. Use timing and smooth movement to survive longer swims.\\u003cbr\\u003e4. Spend rewards on upgrades and return for deeper dives.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGAME HIGHLIGHTS:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Fluid underwater endless swimming\\u003cbr\\u003e- Collectibles, upgrades, and score runs\\u003cbr\\u003e- Increasing challenge as you dive farther\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play offline on phone or tablet\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Engaging core gameplay loop\\u003cbr\\u003e- Progression with coins, upgrades, or stages\\u003cbr\\u003e- High scores and saved progress\\u003cbr\\u003e- Settings for sound and preferences\\u003cbr\\u003e- Optimized for phones and tablets\"],\"tianzijian\",\"1+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RJwb9lYOpZYjTYU0wLR59Rh16q_4WnAIzeSNYC3rvYYdgoVaZrz5BXryEzapi13B-OnnjhEt5xI2kZVPNQGQXw\"],null,[211,194,164,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003ePelajari lebih lanjut\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia. Beberapa kekerasan dalam konteks komikal atau fantasi dapat diterima. Bahasa kasar tidak diizinkan.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bvngfhjrthdhub.dashdodge\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bvngfhjrthdhub.dashdodge\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[