 hiding spot. Relax, observe, and carefully match your character with the environment around you. From colorful objects to tricky patterns, every scene gives you a new way to blend in and disappear.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Simple controls and easy-to-learn gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Smooth and satisfying painting mechanics.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Test your observation and attention to detail.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Colorful scenes with unique camouflage challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThink fast, paint smart and don’t get spotted. Download now!\"],\"HIGAME Studio\",\"500.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6pmfuzuDPhe-enYbvadb6VcjdfEYtzFJ58zKZjk6yDfVSeOPkhcNQGp02BPeKK16ldy1e8FKmcFiabudWYsW\"],null,[140,59,27,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003ePelajari lebih lanjut\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia. Beberapa kekerasan dalam konteks komikal atau fantasi dapat diterima. Bahasa kasar tidak diizinkan.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.hp.paint.color.hide.seek.guys\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.hp.paint.color.hide.seek.guys\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Instal\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,