, keep him happy and help him explore his world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Talking Tom can really talk \\u003cbr\\u003e- Fashion and furniture items to collect \\u003cbr\\u003e- Mini games add action, adventure and fun \\u003cbr\\u003e- Travel destinations are waiting to be explored \\u003cbr\\u003e- Photo albums to be filled with memories \\u003cbr\\u003e- And more \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom Outfit7, creators of My Talking Tom 2, My Talking Tom Friends, My Talking Angela 2 and My Talking Angela.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app contains:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Promotion of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s products and advertising;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Links that direct customers to Outfit7’s websites and other apps;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Personalization of content to encourage users to play the app again;\\u003cbr\\u003e- YouTube integration to allow users to watch videos of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s animated characters;\\u003cbr\\u003e- The option to make in-app purchases;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Subscriptions which automatically renew at the end of a subscription period unless cancelled. You can manage and cancel your subscription any time via Settings in your Google Play account;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Items to purchase (available in different prices) using virtual currency, depending on the player’s progress;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Alternative options to access all functionalities of the app without making any in-app purchases using real money.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of use: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/eula/en/\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy policy for games: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/privacy-policy-games/en\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer support: support@outfit7.com\"],\"Outfit7 Limited\",\"1.000.000.000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Uj6LsxlFPOs32u69TW5dPRgxeHCyv9xbIe3PPHEMTv92D5KHoYIYCJfsh-Xd1cWBS-iw9JQtneI69mgqtsJp\"],null,[118,208,229,255]],null,[\"Rating 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,nul