oogleusercontent.com/8iaawyZHkgo2LfrVe94SN4xyMf89cKjBivfmOr9sg7qaanLyDRXEnYKbNd8i2hSI8C3seL6X7K2s6qUihVNs\"]]],\"Mystery Dumpling: Squishy Box\",[\"4,6\",4.6380954],\"Kasual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.unbox.mystery.dumpling.squishy\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.unbox.mystery.dumpling.squishy\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.unbox.mystery.dumpling.squishy\"]],[\"qgJvGm0IJ0oTCKPKxrDHkJcDFSkItwAdcYkOKPoBDAoKCAASBgoCaWQQAboCRAooCiJjb20udW5ib3gubXlzdGVyeS5kdW1wbGluZy5zcXVpc2h5EAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Mystery Dumpling: Squishy Box!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOpen mystery boxes and discover an adorable collection of squishy dumpling characters. Every box contains a surprise, and every new character brings you closer to completing the ultimate collection.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore colorful collections, unlock rare squishy dumplings, and enjoy satisfying unboxing moments. From common characters to legendary surprises, there\\u0026#39;s always something exciting waiting inside the next box.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Open Mystery Boxes\\u003cbr\\u003eReveal cute squishy dumplings hidden inside every surprise box.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🥟 Collect Unique Characters\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock common, rare, epic, and legendary dumplings to complete your collection.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Discover Rare Surprises\\u003cbr\\u003eFind special mystery characters with unique designs and colorful appearances.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📚 Complete Your Collection\\u003cbr\\u003eFill your collection box and unlock new rewards as you discover more characters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Relaxing Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple controls, satisfying unboxing animations, and enjoyable collecting for players of all ages.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Cute \\u0026amp; Colorful Art Style\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy charming squishy characters, fun animations, and a delightful world full of surprises.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you collect every Mystery Dumpling?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Mystery Dumpling: Squishy Box now and start your surprise collecting adventure!\"],\"Brocker Bus Studio\",\"500.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PAI8BsDkqWuyYdBapL-dpmiDrEB8vd4xxUfeiM6B9GCJpf2BDyYonlHJB-MQuVFA5jOTSGnYpqqnaM8vPty-\"],null,[161,83,250,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003ePelajari lebih lanjut\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia. Beberapa kekerasan dalam konteks komikal atau fantasi dapat diterima. Bahasa kasar tidak diizinkan.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.unbox.mystery.dumpling.squishy\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.unbox.mystery.dumpling.squishy\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Instal\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Kasual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,nul