,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fatbrandsinc.mafiahonor\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fatbrandsinc.mafiahonor\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fatbrandsinc.mafiahonor\"]],[\"qgJoGmYIKUoTCKPKxrDHkJcDFSkItwAdcYkOKPoBDAoKCAASBgoCaWQQAboCPQohChtjb20uZmF0YnJhbmRzaW5jLm1hZmlhaG9ub3IQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Step into the underworld and take charge of your own crime family in Mafia Honor-Monetary Reward! As the new Don, you’ll need sharp wits and strategic skills to dominate the city. Combine color-matching puzzles with intense gang warfare to eliminate rivals and expand your territory.\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTurf Wars: Immerse yourself in a gritty gangster world. Plan your moves carefully to seize control of the streets and defend your empire from enemy families.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWeapon Crafting: Match colored blocks to assemble deadly weapons. The more you match, the stronger your arsenal becomes to crush your opponents.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDevastating Power-ups: Connect large chains of same-colored blocks to unlock massive explosives and special items that can turn the tide of battle instantly.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTactical Skills: Deploy active skills and strategic props at the right moment to reverse losing situations and secure unexpected victories.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChallenging Levels: Face uniquely designed stages that test your logic and strategy. Every level brings a new challenge to prove your dominance.\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to rule the underworld? Download Mafia Honor-Monetary Reward now, outsmart your rivals, and claim your throne as the ultimate crime boss\"],\"Lança Sites\",\"500.000+\",null,\"\",null