 activities\\u003cbr\\u003e- Special sticker albums\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eShe’s interactive. She’s customizable. She’s fun. And she’s always ready to make new friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom the creators of My Talking Tom, My Talking Tom 2 and My Talking Tom Friends comes the pet who’s a star in the making.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app contains:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Promotion of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s products and advertising;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Links that direct customers to Outfit7’s websites and other apps;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Personalization of content to encourage users to play the app again;\\u003cbr\\u003e- YouTube integration to allow users to watch videos of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s animated characters;\\u003cbr\\u003e- The option to make in-app purchases;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Subscriptions which automatically renew at the end of a subscription period unless cancelled. You can manage and cancel your subscription any time via Settings in your Google Play account;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Items to purchase (available in different prices) using virtual currency, depending on the player’s progress;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Alternative options to access all functionalities of the app without making any in-app purchases using real money.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of use: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/eula/en/\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy policy for games: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/privacy-policy-games/en\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer support: support@outfit7.com\"],\"Outfit7 Limited\",\"1.000.000.000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bdNHZ9qChYI2QTcgjepYZLMYx378R1xC8uAO2GiTyB7pbyICtgcmUb2feO4ItlYKDssLjpHbbIz0AG5uWX1IqA\"],null,[88,33,80,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Pembelian Dalam Game\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\