8eu5fiOAbSiWroGNQCTdt5ql1U\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9bolbEdFjjSrheLCXUx-8qTmGXtjOPvXA2WaoXOBUQY5lBs4X-pladStdQQpM2-2oyDayIvYblCaVOpltPnU4g\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2KodMgCHu7Mrtumf0zwgvf8jLEVpSqp5BqwZTuAZiXZleFy7bpQ0vlKHpKKP5AU3zKOq6JdXePvAvzHxANHfNg\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OmUwzFQ6ecX0p-hwN5H0VLJUKEQRPIzXro-5Qzo_5TYxkgzqRsFAubyfK3WtA6fNYEA4TUlCbK5sVqtUjUct\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/al0eCtDd3KaAvbGSmtsAKs_s4iECDTCi1nZzQn90ArMAemV_Jn_Df03TbcSFWNCiZ0pO6ohFYhcKHQglBBM_Lg\"]]],\"World Flags: Color Puzzle\",[\"4,4\",4.372937],\"Kasual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcasual.flags.world.color\\u0026rdid\\u003dcasual.flags.world.color\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcasual.flags.world.color\"]],[\"qgJlGmMIPEoTCKPKxrDHkJcDFSkItwAdcYkOKPoBDAoKCAASBgoCaWQQAboCOgoeChhjYXN1YWwuZmxhZ3Mud29ybGQuY29sb3IQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Get ready to embark on a vibrant journey with World Flags: Color Puzzle, the ultimate game for flag enthusiasts and puzzle lovers alike! If you have a passion for national flags and a flair for colors, this hyper-casual game is tailor-made for you. 🖌️🎮\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA Global Challenge of Colors and Flags:\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨🌍 Welcome to the Colorful World of World Flags: Color Puzzle! 🌟🏳️\\u200d🌈 In the World Flags: Color Puzzle, your mission is to paint the national flags of the world with the right colors. This isn\\u0026#39;t just about painting; it\\u0026#39;s about testing your knowledge and memory of different national flags. Can you remember the colors of each flag and recreate them accurately?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy World Flags: Color Puzzle is Irresistibly Fun:\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Test Your Flag Knowledge: Challenge your recognition skills by drawing and painting various national flags. It’s a fun way to learn and remember the flags of the world!\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Easy Gameplay, Challenging Memory Test: While the gameplay is straightforward, remembering and correctly coloring each flag offers a satisfying challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Engaging Levels: With a multitude of flags to color, each level presents a new opportunity to test your memory and painting skills.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Perfect for All Ages: Whether you’re a geography buff, a casual gamer, or a curious learner, World Flags: Color Puzzle is suitable for players of all ages.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to put your flag knowledge to the test and have loads of fun while doing it? Download World Flags: Color Puzzle now and start your artistic and puzzle journey around the globe! Embark on a colorful exploration of national flags with World Flags: Color Puzzle! Download now and start painting! 🌈🌏📲\"],\"kiwilab\",\"5.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/B_vAk9G6tmao_HLhgct4sjhqiSj1MyFm-SgN3FlVtiqSz7GCGEzFDoJJrVK7p_e68mzfjyKDIjbN2q1k0q71eQ\"],null,[244,242,241,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003ePelajari lebih lanjut\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia. Beberapa kekerasan dalam konteks komikal atau fantasi dapat diterima. Bahasa kasar tidak diizinkan.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcasual.flags.world.color\\u0026rdid\\u003dcasual.flags.world.color\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Instal\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"Rp 31.000 - Rp 399.000 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Kasual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.plug.runner.battery.mates\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ST_8FIgzNFD6O4iz5aZ9oVDXMGJxJQHsGHjQj4tktTpxhZR5BR94sO37iATgnPYxxOQdS7OYNNevvy-lUS9Fww\"],null,[6,121,241,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[998,561],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/T9OEGRr-VB0htVfcZ5ifjtz3O97HoIwVlawgbWjZllnlEyLdh1NwNIomqfZICIgLyzTGG75aWUjmgj49y1oylw\"]],[null,2,[995,560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xCJK4D2pSyXeH6c83dzoWluxyR9-n_njYlQgp6ALuTgaeuFsJZJx3ygE93g33RWcfWzeMv7pXEx0V8Yk-1CC38g\"]],[null,2,[995,559],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PZhgwM6RajmRKy9GJ81sLHDMbKYGvWEFkfpYnfeqqUTGvCPCI6QRLEspDzLj6LG1CPx1tpR-ttYzQUs0TgFQzg\"]],[null,2,[995,560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/063u84cLPCPjH2XvzZ12PzUOho143s6XY1FboQuTxzmSgIxjBMGpHxr8KlnKt2O2ziQfQRpxf8Rcm0CbAl3p\"]]],\"Plug Runner\",[\"3,2\",3.24],\"Kasual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plug.runner.battery.mates\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.plug.runner.battery.mates\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plug.runner.battery.mates\"]],[\"qgJqGmgIPUoTCKPKxrDHkJcDFSkItwAdcYkOKPoBDAoKCAASBgoCaWQQAboCPwojCh1jb20ucGx1Zy5ydW5uZXIuYmF0dGVyeS5tYXRlcxABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"⚡ Get ready for the most electrifying race of your life! ⚡\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Plug Runner, the ultimate racing game where energy is everything! Take control of your plug character, charge up, and dash your way to victory in this highly addictive and fun competition! 🏃\\u200d♂️💨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔋 COLLECT \\u0026amp; GROW HUGE!\\u003cbr\\u003eRun across the track and collect batteries that match your color. The more you collect, the bigger and stronger you become! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚤 POWER UP VEHICLES \\u0026amp; OVERCOME OBSTACLES!\\u003cbr\\u003eYou\\u0026#39;re not just running—you are the power source! Use your energy to plug into awesome vehicles like cars, speedboats, and motorcycles, or use your raw power to smash through massive brick walls! 🧱🏍️\\u003cbr\\u003eCareful though! Powering these obstacles drains your energy and makes you shrink. You\\u0026#39;ll need to keep collecting batteries to stay in the race!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 SMASH YOUR RIVALS!\\u003cbr\\u003eSize matters in Plug Runner! If you are bigger and stronger than your opponents, bump into them to knock them down! 🥊 They will stay on the ground for a few seconds and drop special Black Batteries that anyone can collect for a massive power boost. Show no mercy!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏁 BE THE FIRST TO FINISH!\\u003cbr\\u003eIt’s a thrilling dash to the end. Power through the obstacles, manage your energy wisely, outsmart your rivals, and be the first to cross the finish line to claim the crown! 👑\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ GAME FEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Simple \\u0026amp; Addictive: Easy one-finger swipe controls, perfect for everyone!\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Vibrant 3D Graphics: Colorful paths, satisfying animations, and dynamic gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚗 Epic Power-Ups: Steer boats, ride bikes, and break walls!\\u003cbr\\u003e🥊 Fun Combat Mechanic: Knock down smaller players and steal their energy.\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Endless Racing Fun: Multiple levels with different challenges to test your skills!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you fully charged and ready to run? ⚡ Download Plug Runner NOW and electrify the competition! 🔌🏁\"],\"AbbaYosua.Design\",\"1.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8Mp8IMSw2z47-vf8UwqDBzzbgRXX5TzEg_hLcrjnioOWWAn83F73IYhhldW_VO8PfKlvM2-pHrOlnZm7UWRX\"],null,[222,200,87,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003ePelajari lebih lanjut\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia. Beberapa kekerasan dalam konteks komikal atau fantasi dapat diterima. Bahasa kasar tidak diizinkan.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plug.runner.battery.mates\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.plug.runner.battery.mates\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Instal\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,