ure\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mergefish.idle\"]],[\"qgJfGl0IQUoTCKPKxrDHkJcDFSkItwAdcYkOKPoBDAoKCAASBgoCaWQQAboCNAoYChJjb20ubWVyZ2VmaXNoLmlkbGUQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to a relaxing fish-merging adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003eDive into a colorful underwater world where every merge brings a new discovery. Spend Shells to summon adorable fish, then merge two fish of the same level to discover new, higher-level fish and grow your collection.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Simple and Satisfying Merge Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eDrag and drop two fish of the same level to merge them into a new, higher-level fish. With simple and intuitive controls, it’s easy to start merging, collecting, and discovering new fish.\\u003cbr\\u003e❤️Collect a Wide Variety of Fish\\u003cbr\\u003eUse Shells to summon all kinds of charming fish. Discover fish with different colors, shapes, and personalities as you continue merging and expanding your collection. See how many you can unlock!\\u003cbr\\u003e🏡 Unlock Beautiful Underwater Scenes\\u003cbr\\u003eAs your collection grows, unlock new underwater environments and enjoy a fresh backdrop for your fish. Explore relaxing ocean scenes and watch your underwater world become more colorful as you progress.\\u003cbr\\u003e📲Start your fish-collection journey and discover what your next merge will bring!\"],\"Jamalgad\",\"50.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-7MMNHTkWvALXYb7bRjNr1Ha7f-ITCzyFnPhbYHWagu0k8VYApsV44umunYq5kY9ityVA7Cxrfe6kUo6QsyqJmA\"],null,[40,164,214,255]],null,[\"Rating 18+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QNpsl4k43vdbfwUAlVLZul2W5O5MUGOToystzghc97mljVHbUwtc639tahcuDsAVHdaGMyZA40AmMVcB_ws\"]],[null,\"Reward Uang Tunai\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://suppor