FTT_5_DwPqxiXy25p-gmJ5CSRteNLb2FaIUOPFunnCW8vIX14oDBmhe9K58jQF3kdCFqn6aGZcgQ6PQqmQ\"]],[null,2,[1280,720],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1keEsIvwEHuyN94C6fXeOcLY21ilZ00NU9byiK9_5z5GCtO_IZCGWkUdVCFZlbyywJhqiBSsIO3HMkbw8wlWgg\"]],[null,2,[1280,720],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/h_0yKOJuM2w_cYEmMy_4mmO5dGDxecFIl5yEaT28f5DMYd2wNHKsyM8onanllEUPC0fqGrjiYV_Qczqlb5YyGg\"]]],\"Karnaval Makeup: Berdandan\",[\"3,8\",3.82],\"Kasual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ycgame.makeup\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.ycgame.makeup\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ycgame.makeup\"]],[\"qgJmGmQIU0oTCKPKxrDHkJcDFSkItwAdcYkOKPoBFAoSCLuikLaRx4eOQxIGCgJpZBAAugIzChcKEWNvbS55Y2dhbWUubWFrZXVwEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"f52b_SOGVh4\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:f52b_SOGVh4?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:f52b_SOGVh4\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezklVP4u7fqteyCxYSH0UMsH2sYL2TfcUeDRIlu3KHIMI7hELQeN4-U3nkHHDOC4Y712S8x4evuzsjA19ijD579SKLhvxWaNJzdj6yi7KHGRkIWsgEswWh28_4yEbmMVcJGv8QHqHcqK2s22cIhyjhdwwuxK0xrxxlsQhtzLymqPUHVtEMgaQ0GUxDgCkuzjbFH-kq3LTKLvy-bcj4nCwUt-WLyuLMTelC6XbkZfrc0dhjzjbMN1YRGcCYgm9KhVN2d-rCf5hFTbfnQ19ER2rWZGj-2HElQhS2foPQXVu80siw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/f52b_SOGVh4/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Selamat datang di Karnaval Makeup: Berdandan! Siap menjalani petualangan berdandan seru yang lengkap dengan segala aktivitas favorit para pecinta fashion.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Fitur Utama Game:\\u003cbr\\u003e🔹 Perawatan Wajah Salon\\u003cbr\\u003eBersihkan jerawat dan noda di wajah, rawat kulit dengan perawatan spa herbal agar tampilan halus dan bercahaya sebelum riasan.\\u003cbr\\u003e🔹 Riasan Wajah Menarik\\u003cbr\\u003eKoleksi kosmetik melimpah: bayangan mata, perona pipi, lipstik, aksesoris dahi dan anting. Buat gaya riasan unik untuk festival karnaval!\\u003cbr\\u003e🔹 Seni Kuku DIY\\u003cbr\\u003eDesain manikur impianmu! Pilih warna cat kuku, tempel stiker bunga, permata dan hiasan cantik lainnya untuk tampilan jari yang mempesona.\\u003cbr\\u003e🔹 Dekorasi Casing Handphone\\u003cbr\\u003eWarnai casing hp dengan semprotan warna, pasang stiker lucu seperti hati, boneka, anjing dan berlian. Buat casing hp eksklusif milikmu sendiri.\\u003cbr\\u003e🔹 Koleksi Pakaian Tradisional\\u003cbr\\u003eBeragam busana batik dan pakaian adat elegan lengkap dengan mahkota, kalung dan aksesoris. Pilih outfit terbaik untuk tampil bersinar di karnaval!\\u003cbr\\u003eCara bermainnya sangat mudah: cukup sentuh dan seret semua item untuk mendekorasi dan berdandan. Tanpa aturan rumit, cocok dimainkan kapan saja untuk mengisi waktu luang.\\u003cbr\\u003eRasakan kepuasan transformasi sebelum dan sesudah berdandan. Gabungkan riasan, manikur, pakaian dan aksesoris untuk menciptakan penampilan paling menawan di festival karnaval.\\u003cbr\\u003e💡Apakah kamu siap menjadi penata gaya terbaik di karnaval kecantikan? Segera main sekarang!\"],\"JoyPop Games\",\"1.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/v2y4oxWHTamXxL-p6v6sgCqH9c3B7TKiFx1R8QlCRw_ed6MqGqmNlDRO3sfqMUVlfpfMX2BPSRJN1B0f60hVkA\"],null,[245,183,161,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003ePelajari lebih lanjut\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia. Beberapa kekerasan dalam konteks komikal atau fantasi dapat diterima. Bahasa kasar tidak diizinkan.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ycgame.makeup\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.ycgame.makeup\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Instal\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"Rp 90.000 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Kasual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.RC56.crafty.blox.world\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7tviKTCxykQjI4K30BLJeaEsdQoyJZV8XEgFjmvWrLcvF_5sONxpZfQ4cSZSpQ4msH2ZIU4H3obaW-u_hRJzMg\"],null,[126,120,114,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O1d6gOZYkseGcfqiIVqmiQQKwOwzIdHIlXLuJSxdDftMjkppVJ7lcAEZgGq4j63y0-FjBGfviCfWWtH6kClq7CU\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LYwFu8VszHFWm7fN_27UV9ITK64y7bZO6UkFtkpF7JogO-O7vAbuDKImqIPlMMOOyYB7zdlRSDu-L-AJqEBsyA\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Sdffq6BB6KMFwPD86e_mEio1NDCi6ARRgsMna0XXpc6hzQ7HEgGhQhpAxcvmG0EtIzG5UMkmi_-0uIpcoUqddmE\"]]],\"Crafty Blox World\",[\"3,7\",3.7052631],\"Kasual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.RC56.crafty.blox.world\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.RC56.crafty.blox.world\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.RC56.crafty.blox.world\"]],[\"qgJnGmUIVEoTCKPKxrDHkJcDFSkItwAdcYkOKPoBDAoKCAASBgoCaWQQAboCPAogChpjb20uUkM1Ni5jcmFmdHkuYmxveC53b3JsZBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Crafty Blox World – The Ultimate Voxel Building \\u0026amp; Action Adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into a limitless pixelated universe where your creativity meets intense action! Crafty Blox World is an open-world sandbox simulator that combines the freedom of building with thrilling combat and survival elements. Whether you want to design massive structures or gear up to fight dangerous monsters, this blocky world has it all!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBUILD YOUR DREAM WORLD\\u003cbr\\u003eUnleash your imagination with an extensive crafting and building system. Gather resources, mine materials, and place blocks to create anything from simple pixel shelters to majestic blocky castles. Shape the terrain and design your unique base down to the very last block.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eACTION, WEAPONS \\u0026amp; COMBAT\\u003cbr\\u003eThis isn\\u0026#39;t just a peaceful building simulator—prepare for a challenge! Arm yourself with an arsenal of powerful weapons, from sharp melee swords to explosive firearms and bombs. Defend your territory against waves of fearsome monsters and hostile creatures that roam the land.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEXPLORE \\u0026amp; SURVIVE\\u003cbr\\u003eVenture into diverse voxel landscapes filled with secrets, hidden materials, and unique biomes. Meet friendly villagers, tame mounts to travel faster, and discover mysterious ecosystems. Adapt, craft better gear, and conquer the ultimate survival test!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKEY FEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMassive Sandbox Freedom: Craft, build, and destroy in a fully interactive 3D voxel world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDynamic Action Combat: Fight monsters using unique weapons, guns, and explosives.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRich Ecosystem: Encounter various friendly creatures, unique animals, and dangerous enemies.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCharacter Customization: Personalize your character with cool skins and unique accessories.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSmooth Mobile Optimization: Enjoy colorful blocky graphics and intuitive controls tailored for your device. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe horizon is waiting for you. Download Crafty Blox World now, grab your weapons, and start building your legacy today!\"],\"Tappy Game\",\"1.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FrQjnN3VxnoxnRrm39kUtMi7cnkbUoIj99oxOyjfj2jatlzRll3tf1NWs_X0xC95IztyMGL0fQuorzktlBzU\"],null,[132,206,37,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003ePelajari lebih lanjut\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia. Beberapa kekerasan dalam konteks komikal atau fantasi dapat diterima. Bahasa kasar tidak diizinkan.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.RC56.crafty.blox.world\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.RC56.crafty.blox.world\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Instal\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]