\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.wiwitsugeh.popblast\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.wiwitsugeh.popblast\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.wiwitsugeh.popblast\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIVkoTCKPKxrDHkJcDFSkItwAdcYkOKPoBDAoKCAASBgoCaWQQAboCOQodChdjb20ud2l3aXRzdWdlaC5wb3BibGFzdBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"A relaxing bubble shooting and matching game where you can enjoy aiming, bouncing, and clearing colorful balls.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAim and shoot colored balls to connect matching colors and clear them from the board.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChoose the right shooting angle, create matches, and gradually clear the colorful ball formations.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eComplete each level by clearing the required balls.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAs you progress, new ball layouts and obstacles are introduced, bringing more variety and challenge to every shot.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBright and colorful cartoon visuals, perfect for quick and relaxing play sessions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple, intuitive controls focused on satisfying matching, clearing, and chain reactions.\"],\"Jari Pertama\",\"50.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1dIqH7p0VwV6NwU4flU1cg1avudJiCKEs2-No59H_KXq5FJAHRHFXN4Jos3QHlnCVEUXX_HdA7SgdcURHpLiFw\"],null,[45,9,157,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"